_5_-how-do-i-cancel/reschedule-an-appointment?-1" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:how-do-i-cancelreschedule-an-appointment&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="how-do-i-cancelreschedule-an-appointment">How do I cancel/reschedule an appointment?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_5_-how-do-i-cancel/reschedule-an-appointment?-1-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_5_-how-do-i-cancel/reschedule-an-appointment?-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_5_-how-do-i-cancel/reschedule-an-appointment?-1" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_5_-how-do-i-cancel/reschedule-an-appointment?-1" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">We understand that plans change. Please call us at 844-765-5826 to change or cancel your appointment. Cancellations within 24 hours of service time may be subject to a fee.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-appointment?-2"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-appointment?-2" id="accordion-header-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-appointment?-2" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-appointment?-2" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:what-should-i-expect-during-my-appointment&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="what-should-i-expect-during-my-appointment">What should I expect during my appointment?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-appointment?-2-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-appointment?-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-appointment?-2" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-appointment?-2" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Our full-time Goodyear Mobile Garage employees are trained and well-qualified to service your vehicles and advise you on your car care needs. They will arrive within your arrival window with a fully-equipped van to your home, office, or other preferred location to complete tire installations, oil changes, and more at a time and place that works best for you. </p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">On the day of your appointment, you'll receive a text message when our technician is on the way. </p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">To ensure a smooth experience, please follow these guidelines: </p><ul class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 !normal-case mb-2"><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case">Park your vehicle in a safe place off the roadway with your alarm disabled</li><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case">Provide consent for Goodyear Mobile Garage to service your vehicle</li><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case">Leave at least 3 feet of space on all sides of your vehicle</li><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case">If parked in a covered location, provide at least 10 feet of vertical clearance for our van to park nearby</li><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case">For tire installation, if your wheels have wheel locks, provide the wheel lock key during Your Appointment</li></ul><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">At the time of your appointment, our technician will ask you for your keys and we take it from there! </p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">When the work is completed, our technician will confirm that the Tire Pressure Monitoring System (TPMS) light is off (only if you booked a tire installation). All done!</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-oil-change?-3"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-oil-change?-3" id="accordion-header-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-oil-change?-3" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-oil-change?-3" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:what-should-i-expect-during-my-oil-change&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="what-should-i-expect-during-my-oil-change">What should I expect during my oil change?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-oil-change?-3-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-oil-change?-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-oil-change?-3" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-oil-change?-3" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">An oil change is a comprehensive maintenance service during which we carefully replace your vehicle’s oil, check all other fluids, replace your oil filter, and inspect your engine for leaks. Our technicians will show up on the day of your appointment and replace your oil at your preferred location.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-tire-change?-4"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-tire-change?-4" id="accordion-header-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-tire-change?-4" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-tire-change?-4" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:what-should-i-expect-during-my-tire-change&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="what-should-i-expect-during-my-tire-change">What should I expect during my tire change?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-tire-change?-4-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-tire-change?-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_5_-what-should-i-expect-during-my-tire-change?-4" clas